<item>
            <title>[KYLIN-5228] There is length limitation during loading properties to Kylin config in Kylin5.0. </title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/KYLIN-5228</link>
                <project id="12316121" key="KYLIN">Kylin</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;Currently we use properties.list() to get kylin config from properties to string, but this method results in a maximum length limit (which is set as 37 )for each properties. We can leverage the properties.store() method&lt;/p&gt;</description>
                <environment></environment>
        <key id="13476824">KYLIN-5228</key>
            <summary>There is length limitation during loading properties to Kylin config in Kylin5.0. </summary>
